.TH MOUNT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mount \- mounts a filesystem in the calling mount namespace, subject to filesystem rules and privileges
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mount.h>
.B int mount(const char* source, const char* target, const char* filesystem, unsigned long flags, const void* data);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mounts a filesystem in the calling mount namespace, subject to filesystem rules and privileges.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mount (2)
